[1;33m[WARN][0m   Review: changes_requested (5 issue(s)) — The implementation adds the `includeDraft` flag to the Contentstack factory methods and interfaces, and configures `live_preview` on the Stack initialization. However, the change is incomplete: the `includeDraft` parameter is never propagated through the public-facing functions (`getEntry`, `getSingleEntry`, `getSingletonEntry`, `getSingletonEntry`) — their interfaces lack the field and the functions don't pass it to the factory. No page-level `getStaticProps` passes `context.preview` through. Consequently, the flag is dead code and none of the three acceptance criteria (draft display in preview, live update without rebuild, published content outside preview) are actually achievable. Additionally, no unit tests were added for this feature. The `.toJSON()` call ordering is also potentially fragile. Verdict: changes_requested.

